From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:00:09 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] VideoPlayer: open the next playlist item while the last plays
 out

A parked player opens the next item's input and demuxer only when the
application plays it, so the type lookup, connect, cache fill and probe
all run while the old picture is held. The old item's input ended
seconds earlier, and nothing reads during its play out.
---
